data: {"id": "89f9c6b3773149d3-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "89f9c6b3773149d3", "seq": 670, "ts_ms": 1789043896353, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 8.193, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1541, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-z7kdp` | ImagePullBackOff | Pod aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-z7kdp 处于 ImagePullBackOff 状态，容器 `app` 无法启动 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason=\"ImagePullBackOff\"` | 确认 Pod 容器 `app` 当前终止于拉取镜像的失败状态 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes | `pod.phase=\"Pending\"`, `restart_count=0` | 确认 Pod 调度成功但因无法拉取镜像始终处于挂起状态，且未发生过有效启动 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Back-off pulling image \"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\"` | 反映 kubelet 正在进行指数退避重试，直接印证了拉取动作的持续失败 |\n| 4 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Failed ... dial tcp: lookup registry.invalid on 127.0.0.53:53: no such host` | 提供底层根本原因：DNS 解析失败，确认为镜像地址配置错误而非网络连通性问题 |\n| 5 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"ImagePullBackOff\"}=1` | 独立指标源验证了 Kubernetes API 报告的等待状态 |\n\nKubernetes 事件明确指出了失败的根本原因是 DNS 解析失败（`no such host`），这与 `ImagePullBackOff` 的状态和指标高度一致。由于容器始终未能启动，日志和链路追踪维度无业务数据产出，当前事实已足以闭环验证根因。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 配置了无效域名 registry.invalid 的镜像地址 → kubelet 执行 PullImage 时 DNS 解析失败 (no such host) → 镜像拉取失败并触发指数退避 (Back-off) → Pod 持续处于 ImagePullBackOff 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是：**镜像仓库配置错误**。\n\nPod 配置了不可达的镜像地址 `registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing`，导致 kubelet 在尝试拉取镜像时，底层 DNS 解析查询失败（见证据 #4 `no such host`）。由于镜像始终无法获取，kubelet 按照退避策略反复重试（见证据 #3），最终导致容器处于 `ImagePullBackOff` 状态，Pod 保持 `Pending`（见证据 #1、#2）。该结论由 Kubernetes API 事实与 Prometheus 指标相互印证。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-z7kdp` | ImagePullBackOff | Pod aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-z7kdp 处于 ImagePullBackOff 状态，容器 `app` 无法启动 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason=\"ImagePullBackOff\"` | 确认 Pod 容器 `app` 当前终止于拉取镜像的失败状态 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes | `pod.phase=\"Pending\"`, `restart_count=0` | 确认 Pod 调度成功但因无法拉取镜像始终处于挂起状态，且未发生过有效启动 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Back-off pulling image \"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\"` | 反映 kubelet 正在进行指数退避重试，直接印证了拉取动作的持续失败 |\n| 4 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Failed ... dial tcp: lookup registry.invalid on 127.0.0.53:53: no such host` | 提供底层根本原因：DNS 解析失败，确认为镜像地址配置错误而非网络连通性问题 |\n| 5 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"ImagePullBackOff\"}=1` | 独立指标源验证了 Kubernetes API 报告的等待状态 |\n\nKubernetes 事件明确指出了失败的根本原因是 DNS 解析失败（`no such host`），这与 `ImagePullBackOff` 的状态和指标高度一致。由于容器始终未能启动，日志和链路追踪维度无业务数据产出，当前事实已足以闭环验证根因。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 配置了无效域名 registry.invalid 的镜像地址 → kubelet 执行 PullImage 时 DNS 解析失败 (no such host) → 镜像拉取失败并触发指数退避 (Back-off) → Pod 持续处于 ImagePullBackOff 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是：**镜像仓库配置错误**。\n\nPod 配置了不可达的镜像地址 `registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing`，导致 kubelet 在尝试拉取镜像时，底层 DNS 解析查询失败（见证据 #4 `no such host`）。由于镜像始终无法获取，kubelet 按照退避策略反复重试（见证据 #3），最终导致容器处于 `ImagePullBackOff` 状态，Pod 保持 `Pending`（见证据 #1、#2）。该结论由 Kubernetes API 事实与 Prometheus 指标相互印证。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: final
data: {"id": "89f9c6b3773149d3-final", "run_id": "89f9c6b3773149d3", "seq": 672, "ts_ms": 1789043896362, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-z7kdp` | ImagePullBackOff | Pod aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-z7kdp 处于 ImagePullBackOff 状态，容器 `app` 无法启动 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason=\"ImagePullBackOff\"` | 确认 Pod 容器 `app` 当前终止于拉取镜像的失败状态 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes | `pod.phase=\"Pending\"`, `restart_count=0` | 确认 Pod 调度成功但因无法拉取镜像始终处于挂起状态，且未发生过有效启动 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Back-off pulling image \"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\"` | 反映 kubelet 正在进行指数退避重试，直接印证了拉取动作的持续失败 |\n| 4 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Failed ... dial tcp: lookup registry.invalid on 127.0.0.53:53: no such host` | 提供底层根本原因：DNS 解析失败，确认为镜像地址配置错误而非网络连通性问题 |\n| 5 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"ImagePullBackOff\"}=1` | 独立指标源验证了 Kubernetes API 报告的等待状态 |\n\nKubernetes 事件明确指出了失败的根本原因是 DNS 解析失败（`no such host`），这与 `ImagePullBackOff` 的状态和指标高度一致。由于容器始终未能启动，日志和链路追踪维度无业务数据产出，当前事实已足以闭环验证根因。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 配置了无效域名 registry.invalid 的镜像地址 → kubelet 执行 PullImage 时 DNS 解析失败 (no such host) → 镜像拉取失败并触发指数退避 (Back-off) → Pod 持续处于 ImagePullBackOff 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是：**镜像仓库配置错误**。\n\nPod 配置了不可达的镜像地址 `registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing`，导致 kubelet 在尝试拉取镜像时，底层 DNS 解析查询失败（见证据 #4 `no such host`）。由于镜像始终无法获取，kubelet 按照退避策略反复重试（见证据 #3），最终导致容器处于 `ImagePullBackOff` 状态，Pod 保持 `Pending`（见证据 #1、#2）。该结论由 Kubernetes API 事实与 Prometheus 指标相互印证。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 59.0s\n├─ 问题定位: 16.2s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 34.6s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-z7kdp: 34.6s (Evidence 26.6s, RCA 7.9s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.2s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-z7kdp**: pod-imagepull-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 59.03, "metrics": {"run_id": "89f9c6b3773149d3", "mttr": {"value": "59.0s", "seconds": 59.03626489639282, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-imagepull-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 59036.26489639282, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 55516.98565483093, "tool_calls": 14, "executed_tool_calls": 12, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 1, "successful_tool_calls": 10, "failed_tool_calls": 4, "tool_duration_ms": 7562.323808670044, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 3178.4348487854004}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 16198.494672775269, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "du